flowchart TD
    A([User selects Backup / Restore]) --> B{Operation}
    B -- Export --> C[Choose Full Backup or Collection Export]
    C --> D[Create consistent data snapshot]
    D --> E[Collect referenced media]
    E --> F[Build versioned archive and encrypt]
    F --> G[Validate archive and write temporary file]
    G --> H[Open OS save/share interface]
    H --> I([Report export result])
    B -- Import --> J[Select backup file]
    J --> K[Validate container and format version]
    K --> L[Request passphrase and authenticate/decrypt]
    L --> M[Stage records and media]
    M --> N[Validate schema, IDs, hashes, and references]
    N --> O[Show import preview]
    O --> P{User confirms?}
    P -- No --> Q[Discard staging files]
    P -- Yes --> R[Apply recoverable import/restore]
    R --> S[Reconcile reminders and clean staging]
    S --> T([Report success])
    K -. invalid .-> U([Fail without changing live data])
    L -. wrong password .-> U
    N -. corrupt/incompatible .-> U
